{"id":"b737284edefb717b717d924a810be28f23a6a715","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247651","title":"工具类软件开发将死","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Epimetheus007","excerpt":"奇思妙想 - @Epimetheus007 - 以后对着手机说出你的需求，手机上会自动生成一个应用图标，点开即用，再也不用去应用商店下载了。电脑端应该是也一样。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n            \n            \n            <div id=\"Rightbar\">\n                <p>\r\n这是一个专门讨论 idea 的地方。</p><p>\r\n\r\n每个人的时间，资源是有限的，有的时候你或许能够想到很多 idea，但是由于现实的限制，却并不是所有的 idea 都能够成为现实。</p><p>\r\n\r\n那这个时候，不妨可以把那些 idea 分享出来，启发别人。\r\n\r\n</p></div>\n            <div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>以后对着手机说出你的需求，手机上会自动生成一个应用图标，点开即用，再也不用去应用商店下载了。\n电脑端应该是也一样。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/工具\"><li></li> 工具</a><a href=\"/tag/软件\"><li></li> 软件</a><a href=\"/tag/需求\"><li></li> 需求</a></P><p><span>20 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-10 18:39:10 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164169\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da2c/3049/645050_normal.png?m=1784194513\" alt=\"GoogleQi\" data-uid=\"645050\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GoogleQi\">GoogleQi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:11:36 +08:00\">9h 35m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我想点个外卖，我想打开支付宝种种树，我想打开王者荣耀打两把游戏</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164188\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/950278cf5f637f3f0ddc116601e93969?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nsjs\" data-uid=\"507787\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nsjs\">nsjs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:14:25 +08:00\">9h 32m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>数据怎么流通呢，特别是云端。如果上云了，安全性怎么办呢，特别是支付……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164193\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4a6/8f71/543598_normal.png?m=1754743246\" alt=\"MossFox\" data-uid=\"543598\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MossFox\">MossFox</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:15:06 +08:00\">9h 32m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以为了提前保住应用商店生态，Apple 不允许这类 “用来生成其他应用的应用” 上架了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164258\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4b84/2771/88764_normal.png?m=1772689002\" alt=\"kenshinhu\" data-uid=\"88764\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kenshinhu\">kenshinhu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:28:42 +08:00\">9h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不一定，按需生成和复用成熟工具并不冲突。比如让 AI 做一个表格，它可以调用现成的库，按 xlsx 规范生成文件，没必要每次重新定义格式、实现一套表格软件。Skill 也可以把这些调用流程封装起来，但背后被复用的工具能力，仍然需要开发和维护。所以入口可能会变，不能直接推导出工具类软件开发将死。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164329\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3ee84a74ba01ac19a27b946b339d1042?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"szabc\" data-uid=\"686571\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/szabc\">szabc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:41:10 +08:00\">9h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跑个半天才把工具生成，然后还不能正常使用，当然不排除以后能优化好，缓存般的快速生成打开</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164351\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/940ed92592dde5d05be484229a941420?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"iOCZS\" data-uid=\"661225\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iOCZS\">iOCZS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:45:00 +08:00\">9h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为啥还要生成应用，不应该直接执行你要的功能吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/580f/70c0/600882_normal.png?m=1783912251\" alt=\"lisxour\" data-uid=\"600882\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lisxour\">lisxour</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 16:50:03 +08:00\">8h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>规范标准怎么定？数据同步怎么弄？数据安全怎么保证？最大的问题，算力哪里来？我正常点两下鼠标、戳两下屏幕就能有结果的，现在我要先叭叭叭一大堆，然后再等 AI 叭叭叭一大堆，然后等不知道多久，产出 App 后再得到结果，还不知道结果对不对，你觉得现实吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164460\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4555/12c1/661756_normal.png?m=1767580261\" alt=\"june4\" data-uid=\"661756\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/june4\">june4</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 17:04:53 +08:00\">8h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你昨不说想看电影时现场按你想看的给你生成一个呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164601\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/be86/c551/472822_normal.png?m=1788736901\" alt=\"sillydaddy\" data-uid=\"472822\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sillydaddy\">sillydaddy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 17:31:38 +08:00\">8h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你把 AI 想象成人类的奴隶，让它们跟现在人的生态位一样，就可以无缝想象未来了。你当然可以把奴隶当作计算器来使，比如让它手算矩阵。但更好的用法是，让奴隶自己去写软件、使用软件，用软件聊天、计算、记录、表达。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cdfbcecfac10ddbff28d0a8edc3320df?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Razio\" data-uid=\"494931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Razio\">Razio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 17:43:37 +08:00\">8h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你的意思是，不花钱咯？而且用个成熟软件和莫名其妙的代码生成，能一样吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164729\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4477bb3cd951bd10dc081c72dd608de3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"THESDZ\" data-uid=\"408987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/THESDZ\">THESDZ</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 18:02:19 +08:00\">7h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>应该说是，必须需要人来操作的工具类软件会死亡，会涌现出一大批围绕 AI 增强能力的工具（包括内置）。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164760\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/965e439e25e41cdb03eb10d80d65dab0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wuzhewuyou\" data-uid=\"592699\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wuzhewuyou\">wuzhewuyou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 18:14:09 +08:00\">7h 33m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>言出法随，直接给我来个美女</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18164814\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3c5f/0aa1/167579_normal.png?m=1769244110\" alt=\"hefish\" data-uid=\"167579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n   